Fonts:

No font binary is committed to this repository. `make fonts` downloads the
free, openly-licensed faces (OFL 1.1 / Apache) from Fontsource at build time,
into the gitignored assets/fonts/: Inter, Geist, Geist Mono, JetBrains Mono,
Plus Jakarta Sans, Hanken Grotesk, Archivo, Caveat, Space Grotesk, Instrument
Serif (all OFL 1.1).

Sohne (Klim Type Foundry) is a paid face and is never distributed. It is
used locally only for brand-fidelity captures; supply your own copy at
assets/fonts/local/Sohne.woff2.

Icon and photo sources:

- Brand logos: Simple Icons (simpleicons.org), CC0. A handful of these SVGs
  are committed under assets/icons/ because local demos load them. CC0
  covers the icon file, not the trademark: a company mark stays that
  company's mark.

- Flags: flagcdn.com, public domain. Fetched on demand, not committed.

- Photos: CC0 / CC-BY via the photo fetcher; CC-BY credits are recorded per
  video. Fetched on demand, not committed.

Never distributed:

- Sohne (see Fonts above): a paid face, bring-your-own copy only.

